{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "67", "x": 0.9042195477562772, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.029523700847358492, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Just in front of the first parking zone we can see a farm shop. The old barn was", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.12378835115115883, "w": 0.8069199320095516, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "replaced for a holiday cottages, and relocated close to the chickens, near the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.15211877666808146, "w": 0.8069198294845978, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "river.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.1804491267422191, "w": 0.0560862759789262, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Lot of things have changed since 1950, and Beechwood Farm is not an", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.20877947681635672, "w": 0.8074290709301464, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "exception. Modern times had come, and everyone had to be adjusted to new", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.23710982689049434, "w": 0.8068979916694374, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "ways of living. We still have Beechwood Farm, but a new sophisticated and", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2652919318920643, "w": 0.8069630950151034, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "modern one.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2936593243736476, "w": 0.13029119752529367, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "[ Examiner's comments]", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3531383217812826, "w": 0.2555179699074907, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Here is the examiner's comment:", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3814686718554202, "w": 0.33792801476933476, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "This response addresses all of the changes illustrated in the farm plans. The writer", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.40979902192955786, "w": 0.8265248305698245, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "describes how the farm looked in 1950, then moves on to the present-day plan.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.438129409725088, "w": 0.8267642263369587, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "There is an overview in the last paragraph [Lot of things have changed since 1950,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.46648450503271277, "w": 0.8261205746769721, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "and Beechwood Farm ... a new sophisticated and modern one] but it does not", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.49481485510685036, "w": 0.8263924708544624, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "mention the link to attracting visitors, so is not complete.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5231452429023805, "w": 0.581460868839519, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Information is generally arranged coherently. The first two paragraphs cover the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5514755929765182, "w": 0.826055471331306, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "1950s site, with the remainder focused on the farm today. There is evidence of", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5798059807720483, "w": 0.8267118360855644, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "linking expressions [At the opposite side I That I Nowadeys]; however, there is a", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6081363685675784, "w": 0.8257725024588047, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "lack of reference, resulting in repetition [farm I zone].", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.636466718641716, "w": 0.5451778515752396, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Vocabulary is generally good [parking zone I relocated I exception I adjusted I", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6648341865660843, "w": 0.8258811789098378, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "sophisticated] but errors remain [along the time/ over time I tipycal I sourrounded", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6930162161248693, "w": 0.8262451424958449, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "I Nowadeys I easyer I cottoges].", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7213465661990069, "w": 0.3266399148304704, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Grammatical range is mixed. There are examples of complex sentence forms,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7496769162731445, "w": 0.8266601635088469, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "including [if] clauses and modal forms [could reach I can also find] but there are", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7780073417900671, "w": 0.825812282140881, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "also a range of errors which preclude a higher score.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8063376918642048, "w": 0.5371149816331672, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "To improve the score, an overview that summarises the main changes should be", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8346680419383424, "w": 0.8258377083294246, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "added. It would also be beneficial to show greater accuracy in vocabulary and use", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8630232126887522, "w": 0.8261207797268797, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "of grammatical structures.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8913535627628898, "w": 0.2762468495363258, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}